/*
  SignalCatalogWidget.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 dashboard widget · 0087 · SignalCatalogWidget (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  SignalCatalogWidget resolves (table "SignalCatalogWidget") lives here with its
  web `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  The six keys extracted verbatim from the web source
  (features/dashboard/widgets/SignalCatalogWidget.tsx) are
  widget.signalCatalog.uncategorized, .title, .noData, .signalsAvailable,
  .searchPlaceholder, and .noResults. The rest back the native chrome (registry
  description, freshness chip, state copy, banners, and accessibility phrases).
*/

